# Cursor IDE Rules for the Project

## Folder and File Structure

### General Structure
- All new resources must follow the existing modular structure
- Maintain clear separation between layers: DTO, API, Services, UI, and Pages

### DTOs
- Create in: `src/api/dto/[resource-name]/[ResourceName]Dto.ts`
- Export in file: `src/api/dto/index.ts`
- Follow naming pattern: `[ResourceName]ViewDto`, `[ResourceName]SaveOrUpdateDto`, `[ResourceName]DeleteDto`

### API Integration
- Create in: `src/api/integration/[ResourceName]/[ResourceName]Api.ts`
- Export in file: `src/api/integration/index.ts`
- Functions for CRUD operations: `get[ResourceName]sApi`, `saveOrEdit[ResourceName]Api`, `delete[ResourceName]Api`
- Always use `TABLE_NAME` constant to reference Supabase table

### Services and Hooks
- Create services in: `src/services/[resource-name]/hooks/use[ResourceName].ts`
- Create an `index.ts` in: `src/services/[resource-name]/index.ts`
- Export in file: `src/services/index.ts`
- Implement React hooks with useCallback for all operations

### UI Components
- Create in: `src/ui/components/[resource-name]/[ResourceName]Component.tsx`
- Keep complete page content in: `src/ui/components/[resource-name]/[ResourceName]Page.tsx`

### Pages (Routes)
- Create in: `src/pages/[category]/[resource-name]/index.tsx`
- Files in `src/pages` must only handle routing and render/export components from `src/ui/components`

## Naming Conventions

### Files
- DTOs: `[ResourceName]Dto.ts`
- APIs: `[ResourceName]Api.ts`
- Hooks: `use[ResourceName].ts`
- Components: `[ResourceName]Component.tsx` or `[ResourceName]Page.tsx` in `src/ui/components`

### Variables and Functions
- Methods and variables: always in English, using camelCase
- Constants: UPPERCASE_SNAKE_CASE (e.g., `TABLE_NAME`)
- Type/interface names: PascalCase with descriptive suffix (e.g., `ViewDto`, `SaveOrUpdateDto`)

### Supabase Tables
- Table names: lowercase snake_case (e.g., `rh_coworker`)

